{"unit_id":"wqzhellohhwy__dsh-system-prompts#card-zh","repo":"wqzhellohhwy/dsh-system-prompts","commit":"5b647c27c0bca3e31dd842c42b5e4fa96979a553","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-prompts 是一个面向 DSH Web 设置面板的系统提示词管理插件。它在设置中加入管理页面，并通过宿主 systemPrompt 服务注册提示词段、通过本机 HTTP API 读写配置。用户可以新增多条提示词，编辑标题、正文和段名，调整顺序、启停或删除条目，也可恢复默认；保存后会重新注册提示词，后续请求即可使用。适合希望为 DSH 会话维护自定义系统指令、语言要求或不同提示词段的用户。配置写入 DSH_HOME/system-prompts.json；未设置该环境变量时使用 ~/.dsh，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:20-22","lib/index.js:131-139","lib/index.js:312-352","lib/index.js:388-420","lib/client.js:511-526"]}
{"unit_id":"wqzhellohhwy__dsh-system-prompts#card-en","repo":"wqzhellohhwy/dsh-system-prompts","commit":"5b647c27c0bca3e31dd842c42b5e4fa96979a553","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-system-prompts adds a DSH Web settings page to manage system prompt sections. Users can add, edit, reorder, enable or remove prompts, then save changes for later requests. Settings go to DSH_HOME/system-prompts.json or ~/.dsh by default; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:20-22","lib/index.js:131-139","lib/index.js:312-352","lib/index.js:388-420","lib/client.js:511-526"]}
